<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan silver imports surge 86.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan silver imports surge 86.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's silver imports in January surged by 86.8 percent from a year earlier to 130.00 tonnes, Finance Ministry data released on Friday showed.</p>
<p>The figures released by MOF were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			Jan 97     Dec 96	  Jan 96</p>
<p> Total		130.00	36.00	   69.60</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Mexico		36.67	18.01	   36.01</p>
<p> U.S.		  70.63	 0.00	   15.89</p>
<p>Total imports in 1996 were 1,228.15 tonnes against against 1,177.42 the year before.</p>
</text>
